    },
    "percent left": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Prozent übrig"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "percent of a Pro month left": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Prozent von einem Pro-Monat übrig"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    ", not in use": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": ", nicht in Nutzung"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shown once Causabee reaches its server.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wird angezeigt, sobald Causabee seinen Server erreicht."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kept until it is used.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bleibt, bis es aufgebraucht ist."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Top-ups carry over from month to month.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Guthaben bleibt von Monat zu Monat."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Used. Apple's model on this device reads what comes in — or buy a top-up.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aufgebraucht. Apples Modell auf diesem Gerät liest, was hereinkommt — oder lade Guthaben auf."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Used. Apple's model on this device reads what comes in — or buy another top-up.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aufgebraucht. Apples Modell auf diesem Gerät liest, was hereinkommt — oder lade neues Guthaben auf."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every matter.\nIn its place.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jedes Anliegen.\nAn seinem Platz."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mum’s care, a claim, a move: each in its own place — with what comes next, and who does what by when.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mamas Pflege, ein Schadensfall, ein Umzug: jedes an seinem Platz — mit dem, was als Nächstes kommt, und wer was bis wann tut."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Names are disguised before anything is sent.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Namen werden unkenntlich gemacht, bevor etwas gesendet wird."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One page for each matter": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eine Seite für jedes Anliegen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What comes next, and who does what by when.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Was als Nächstes kommt, und wer was bis wann tut."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "From whatever you have": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aus dem, was du hast"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A screenshot, a photo, a letter, a few words: the bee finds the dates and the tasks.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein Screenshot, ein Foto, ein Brief, ein paar Worte: die Biene findet die Termine und die Aufgaben."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ask about it": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Frag danach"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ask, and get an answer with where it came from.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Frag, und du bekommst eine Antwort mit ihrer Quelle."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What’s on your mind?": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Was beschäftigt dich?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Type it in a few words, or add what you have.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Schreib es in ein paar Worten, oder füg hinzu, was du hast."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mum’s care, a claim, a move …": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mamas Pflege, ein Schadensfall, ein Umzug …"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not sure yet?": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Noch unsicher?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Look around in an example.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sieh dich in einem Beispiel um."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reading …": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wird gelesen …"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Looking in iCloud for your matters …": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Suche deine Anliegen in iCloud …"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Causabee can't read this file.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Causabee kann diese Datei nicht lesen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not read yet — your words are kept.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Noch nicht gelesen — deine Worte sind gesichert."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A start credit is yours: Pro reads your first things, names disguised.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du hast ein Startguthaben: Pro liest deine ersten Dinge, Namen unkenntlich."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Start credit": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Startguthaben"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your start credit is used.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dein Startguthaben ist aufgebraucht."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple's model on this device reads from now on. A top-up lets Pro read again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ab jetzt liest Apples Modell auf diesem Gerät. Mit neuem Guthaben liest Pro wieder."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is you:": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das bist du:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your name, so your tasks show as yours.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dein Name, damit deine Aufgaben als deine erscheinen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Also what comes by mail?": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Auch, was per Mail kommt?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Causabee reads one label or folder you choose — nothing else in your mailbox.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Causabee liest ein Label oder einen Ordner deiner Wahl — sonst nichts in deinem Postfach."
          }
        }
      }
    },
